msgid "study cases list tip fastflood"
msgstr "In this section, you can view and configure flood mitigation case studies for defined areas. To configure your case study, remember to configure the watershed of interest (flood-prone areas). This information will allow WaterProof to estimate the potential benefits of proposed solutions and calculate the return on investment associated with implementing Nature-based Solutions."

msgid "study_case_tip_fastflood"
msgstr "In this section, you can configure case studies for flood mitigation in defined areas.To set up your case study, make sure you have already configured the watershed of interest(flood-prone areas). This information will allow WaterProof to estimate the potential benefits of the proposed solutions and calculate the return on investment associated with NbS implementation."

msgid "Select the analysis watershed"
msgstr "Select the watershed for analysis:"

msgid "select_watershed"
msgstr "Choose the watershed you want to analyze in order to implement Nature-based Solutions(NbS) and reduce flood risk in that region."

msgid "You can select only one watershed."
msgstr "You can select only one watershed."

msgid "biophysical_tip_fastflood"
msgstr "In this section, you can configure the parameters that will guide the flood analysis and its impact on the study region. These parameters are required to calculate the Return on Investment (ROI) and the benefits of the Nature-based Solutions (NbS) to be implemented in the selected watershed."

msgid "analysis_parameter_tip"
msgstr "Please enter the necessary data to configure your case study: the estimated number of years for NbS implementation, the currency in which the economic analysis will be conducted, and the climate scenario, quantile, and storm duration to be used for flood simulation. With this information, the system will be able to calculate the return on investment and simulate the impact of NbS on flood mitigation."

